scenario: SND-EAR-04
title: MacBook speakers loud enough, no distortion
area: Sound
rows: F-DRIVERS-27, F-SND-05
machines: macbookpro, macbook
needs: person
prereq: A MacBook with the Apple speakers. No headphones plugged in.
step: Open Settings, Sound, choose the built-in speakers and set the volume to the middle.
expect: The speakers are listed and chosen.
clause: F-SND-05.chosen
step: Press Play test tone.
expect: You hear two clear notes at a comfortable loudness, not very quiet and not distorted. Both speakers play.
clause: F-DRIVERS-27.loud
step: Set the volume to the top and play the tone once.
expect: The tone is loud and clean; there is no rattling, popping or the sound dropping out.
clause: F-DRIVERS-27.clean
step: Play a radio station in the RADIO tile for one minute.
expect: Music plays without clicks or stutters for the whole minute.
clause: F-SND-05.stream
